{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1095060-magic-queries-additional-realms-glamour-cost-and-unleashing-unknown-arts","id":1095060,"title":"Magic Queries - Additional Realms Glamour Cost and Unleashing Unknown Arts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-05-21T01:26:08-07:00","id":1095060,"title":"Magic Queries - Additional Realms Glamour Cost and Unleashing Unknown Arts","content":"Sorry if this has been answered and I missed it - <br /> <br /> The cantrip rules state that you must spend an additional point of glamour if you use more than one realm (though it doesn't clarify if this is an additional point per realm, or just a single additional point no matter how many realms). <br /> <br /> However, the examples at the end of the chapter seem to ignore this and only note characters spending additional glamour to &quot;cheat&quot; realms they don't have. <br /> <br /> Which is correct?<br /> <br /> Also, am I correct in understanding that you can unleash any Art, even one you don't know? I mean, doing so would guarantee you lose control of the unleashing if you succeed as you have no dots in the Art in question, but under certain circumstances it might be worth it. Is this correct? Or do you need a minimum of one dot in the Art to attempt an unleashing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/187-beccatoria","name":"beccatoria","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar187_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-21T05:40:51-07:00","id":1095095,"title":"","content":"I can't remember exactly what was decided about Glamour costs. I do remember you need to spend a Glamour point for each Realm you want to &quot;cheat.&quot; If you only have Fae 1 but need Fae 5, that would require a Glamour point.<br /> <br /> As for adding Realms, I want to say you only spend Glamour to add a modifier Realm - Scene or Time. I'm not sure though. When spending Glamour on Realms you don't have was added, spending Glamour to combine Realms may have been dropped entirely. Holden and Jonsan could answer this one better.<br /> <br /> You can't Unleash an Art you don't already have at least one dot in. You have to have some knowledge of the Art in order to Unleash it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Charlie Cantrell</b><br /> Onyx Path Freelancer <hr />Changeling: The Dreaming 20th Anniversary Edition, Conquering Heroes, Book of Freeholds, Guide to the Night, C20 Players Guide","edited":{"userid":648,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","user":"PookaKnight","date":".  Typos 05-21-2017, 11:21 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/648-pookaknight","name":"PookaKnight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar648_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"690"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-21T08:16:27-07:00","id":1095138,"title":"","content":"Okay - shame I didn't notice this before the errata thread closed (or hopefully someone else did, that was an epic thread and I don't recall everything raised).<br /> <br /> The page 194 section on Glamour Cost states that it's 1 Glamour for a Wyrd cantrip and then 1 Glamour for each Realm &quot;cheated&quot;. It doesn't mention extra glamour for additional realms.<br /> <br /> The examples at the end of the chapter follow this rule and examples have extra Glamour paid for Realms not known, but not Realms beyond the first (though if they are modifier Realms they do add +1 difficulty).<br /> <br /> However, the &quot;Cantrips: Step by Step&quot; summary inset on page 196 says that the player adds an additional point of Glamour if she uses an additional Realm <i>or</i> &quot;cheats&quot; a Realm. Looks like this is the part that's a holdover from an earlier draft. Easy enough fix!<br /> <br /> For Unleashing, it definitely makes sense that you need to know at least one dot, and that's implied in the opening paragraph - &quot;Learning an Art unlocks a new door into the Dreaming, and a changeling desperate enough can kick that door open.&quot; But when describing the actual process, it doesn't explicitly state that it's only known Arts - it says that a changeling &quot;chooses an Art to unleash&quot;, and since it would automatically fail dangerously, and since the new magic system is a lot more permissive and dynamic, I wasn't totally clear on whether this was a dangerous short cut to any kind of magic if one were willing to risk it.<br /> <br /> I think that limiting it to known Arts is the better choice though.<br /> <br /> Anyway, thanks for clarifying. In general, I like the revamped magic system a lot!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":187,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/187-beccatoria","user":"beccatoria","date":".  typos 05-21-2017, 11:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/187-beccatoria","name":"beccatoria","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar187_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-21T08:49:19-07:00","id":1095145,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>beccatoria</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1095060-magic-queries-additional-realms-glamour-cost-and-unleashing-unknown-arts?p=1095138#post1095138\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Okay - shame I didn't notice this before the errata thread closed (or hopefully someone else did, that was an epic thread and I don't recall everything raised).</div> </div> </div> </div>Rest easy, I put it in there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13395-daniel-knight","name":"Daniel Knight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"96"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-05-21T09:15:56-07:00","id":1095151,"title":"","content":"Yay! Thank you!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/187-beccatoria","name":"beccatoria","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar187_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"85"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}